  "title": "National Grid launches North West London Upgrade project to strengthen electricity network and support future growth",
  "summary": "National Grid has launched its North West London Upgrade (NWLU) project, a major investment designed to strengthen the electricity transmission network, support future growth and unlock new connections across North West London and surrounding areas.Spanning from Sundon substation in Bedfordshire to Elstree substation in Hertfordshire, and on to St John’s Wood substation in London, the complex programme includes new and upgraded substations, new cables, and reinforcement of existing overhead lines.",
